{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22372","headline":"叹老三首 三 · 白居易","name":"叹老三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年种桃核，今岁成花树。\n去岁新婴儿，今年已学步。\n但惊物长成，不觉身衰暮。\n去矣欲何如，少年留不住。\n因书今日意，徧寄诸亲故。\n壮岁不欢娱，长年当悔悟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}